BT /F2 13 Tf 50.0 606.0 Td (1. Executive Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 587.0 Td (QuizArena is a real-time live quiz platform. A host builds quizzes and runs a live session; participants join) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 576.0 Td (with a room code or QR \(no account required\); a display screen shows the session for the room audience.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 557.0 Td (The product is designed for education, corporate events, and entertainment. One host can run one active hosting) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 546.0 Td (room at a time. Sessions are synchronized in near real time: when the host starts a question, every participant) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 535.0 Td (and the display screen receive the same question, timer, and \(later\) reveal and leaderboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 516.0 Td (Concern | Choice) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 505.0 Td (Style | Modular monolith \(one backend process\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 494.0 Td (Frontend | Single React SPA with three role-based experiences) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 483.0 Td (Backend | FastAPI \(REST + native WebSockets\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 472.0 Td (Database | PostgreSQL \(Neon in production\); SQLite for local/tests) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 461.0 Td (Hosting | Vercel \(SPA\) + Render \(API/WS\) + Neon \(DB\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 442.0 Td (Why this architecture: Keeps delivery fast for a v1 product, keeps scoring and timers server-authoritative \(fair) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 431.0 Td (play\), and avoids complexity of microservices while the concurrent load target remains modest \(~5 rooms x ~100) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 420.0 Td (participants\).) Tj ET
50.0 408.0 m 562.0 408.0 l S
