BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 272.0 Td (1. What: Live quiz platform - host builds content, players join by code, big screen syncs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 261.0 Td (2. How built: One FastAPI backend + one React app; Postgres; WebSockets for live sync.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 250.0 Td (3. Fairness: Server owns timers and scores; clients only display and submit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 239.0 Td (4. Data model: Editable quiz templates + immutable session snapshots per live room.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 228.0 Td (5. Scale \(v1\): Single always-on API instance; suitable for classroom / event sized load.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 217.0 Td (6. Deploy: Neon DB, Render API/WS, Vercel frontend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 206.0 Td (7. Security: JWT hosts, room tokens for players, bcrypt, rate limits, CORS, audit logs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50.0 195.0 Td (8. Status: End-to-end live flow works without refresh when deployed with current main branch.) Tj ET
